\
4. **Vector Search**:\
   - No Supabase integration\
   - Missing vector embedding support\
   - No career matching functionality\
\
5. **Error Handling & Network Monitoring**:\
   - Basic error handling exists, but not comprehensive\
   - No network availability monitoring\
   - Missing retry logic\
